# Normalize line endings across platforms (macOS + iOS Obsidian).
# Store everything as LF in the repo and check out LF everywhere, so files
# are never marked "modified" just because two devices disagree on EOL.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Markdown is the wiki's content — always treat as text.
*.md text eol=lf

# Common binary assets: leave untouched (no EOL conversion, no diff churn).
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
